Retrieve historical data from the circular buffer.

Returns data in chronological order (oldest to newest).
Handles the wrap-around case when buffer is full.

@param channel - Channel identifier
@param limit - Maximum number of points to return (from most recent)
@returns Array of historical data points in chronological order

@example
```typescript
// Get last 100 data points
const history = dataStreamService.getHistoricalData('device:123', 100);

// Get all available history (up to 1000 points)
const allHistory = dataStreamService.getHistoricalData('device:123');
```

Get performance metrics for monitoring and debugging.

