Create a new WebSocket client.

Automatically converts HTTP URLs to WebSocket URLs (http → ws, https → wss).

@param baseUrl - Base URL for WebSocket server (defaults to VITE_API_URL or localhost:3000)

Establish connection to the WebSocket server.

If already connected or connecting, returns immediately without error.
On successful connection, resets reconnection counters and starts heartbeat.
Emits 'connected' event when connection is established.

@returns Promise that resolves when connected or rejects on error
@throws Error if connection fails (network error, server unavailable)

@example
```typescript
try {
  await client.connect();
  console.log('Connected successfully');
} catch (error) {
  console.error('Connection failed:', error);
}
```

