PluginAdapter class

Wraps legacy IDevicePlugin to provide IPluginV2 compatibility.
All V2-specific methods (patient assignment, state sync, commands)
are no-op implementations with deprecation warnings.

@example
```typescript
// PluginManager detects legacy plugin and wraps it
const legacyPlugin: IDevicePlugin = loadLegacyPlugin();
const adaptedPlugin: IPluginV2 = new PluginAdapter(legacyPlugin);

// Now works with IPluginV2 API (but warnings logged)
adaptedPlugin.assignToPatient('patient-123'); // Logs deprecation warning
```

