Service for synchronizing state changes across multiple devices using a two-phase commit protocol.
Ensures atomic state transitions with automatic rollback on partial failures.

@example
```typescript
const syncService = DeviceSynchronizationService.getInstance(database);
syncService.setSocketIO(io);

// Pause all devices in a session
const result = await syncService.pauseDevices('session-123', ['device-1', 'device-2']);
if (result.failedDevices.length === 0) {
  console.log('All devices paused successfully');
}
```

